  "worked_solution": "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Qr & =[\\begin{aligned}a & b & a \\\\ a & -b & a \\\\ 0 & 0 & a\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}a \\\\ 0 \\\\ -a\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot a & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,b\\cdot 0 & + & a\\cdot (-a) \\\\ a\\cdot a & + & (-b)\\cdot 0 & + & a\\cdot (-a) \\\\ 0\\cdot a & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,0\\cdot 0 & + & a\\cdot (-a)\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{a}^{2} & + & 0 & + & (-{a}^{2}) \\\\ {a}^{2} & + & 0 & + & (-{a}^{2}) \\\\ 0 & + & 0 & + & (-{a}^{2})\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -{a}^{2}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
